# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist*
build/*
*.local

# `dist*` above is meant for build output, but it also matches any path whose
# file name starts with "Dist" — and Windows matches it case-insensitively, so
# e.g. components/charts/DistributionDonutChart.tsx was silently ignored and
# would have broken the build on a fresh clone. Source is never build output.
!src/**/*.ts
!src/**/*.tsx

